  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Heavenly Court’s spy Liu Hao keeps it ready in his immortal aperture during the Southern Border hunt. The Gu can counter Fixed Immortal Travel and prevent it from being used in a certain area.",
        "chapters": [
          1600
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "char_liu_hao",
          "reg_southern_border",
          "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Heavenly Court tampers Liu Hao’s Gu with a refinement path method so that when one Gu leaves the immortal aperture, every Gu self-detonates together. Fang Yuan steals only remnant parts.",
        "chapters": [
          1610
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "self-detonation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fairy Zi Wei notes that Fixed space Immortal Gu has self-detonated, having prepared against great thief ghost hand when she sent Liu Hao. Yuan Qiong Du is prepared to refine fixed space Immortal Gu and the other Gu with Heavenly Court’s refinement path formation.",
        "chapters": [
          1611
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "self-detonation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fairy_zi_wei",
          "char_yuan_qiong_du"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fixed space Immortal Gu can fix a location, so that even when Fixed Immortal Travel activates, the Gu Immortal is carried only to the chosen place.",
        "chapters": [
          1760
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Sources conflict:",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The question is open.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The ambush and the self-detonation in Liu Hao’s body belong to Fang Yuan’s previous life, in which he never obtained the Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1760
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Liu Hao again holds it ready in his immortal aperture, but against Fang Yuan’s jade flow pearl he needs an immortal killer move with it as the core.",
        "chapters": [
          1783
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan takes fixed space Immortal Gu out of Liu Hao’s immortal aperture; when it starts to detonate, Gu as before formation stops the destruction and the Gu settles with slight injuries.",
        "chapters": [
          1795
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In this life Yuan Qiong Du has tried to refine fixed space Gu in Heavenly Court and failed.",
        "chapters": [
          1852
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
